    "The source is OpenWaterAnalytics/EPANET Net3.inp at pinned commit 4d8d82ddc260fce216af9321fc3d9a4646ac6827; its exact source bytes are bound by SHA-256 d95b068194ba747605bea851d608333e577ac667658aaa1680cf1c07e43faf53 and length 30063.",
